falcon-protocols provides CMake targets:

    find_package(FalconProtocols CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Falcon::protocols)

falcon-protocols provides the following features:

  http         HTTP/HTTPS plugin (default; pulls curl + openssl)
  ftp          FTP plugin (pulls curl)
  bittorrent   BitTorrent full data plane via libtorrent (pulls libtorrent)
  sftp         SFTP plugin (pulls libssh2)
  webdav       WebDAV plugin (pulls curl)
  metalink     Metalink plugin (pulls expat + openssl)
  nat          NAT port mapping facade, UPnP IGD + NAT-PMP (pulls miniupnpc + libnatpmp)
